# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo, checked out as-is.
# Prettier's default endOfLine is "lf"; without this file, Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true convert files to CRLF and
# `prettier --check .` fails on Windows CI while passing on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Demo-video assets and the vendored faces that render them. Without
# these, `* text=auto eol=lf` above would treat them as text and corrupt
# them on checkout.
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
